<view class="page"><view class="panel"><view class="row"><view><view class="section-title">蓝牙适配器</view><view class="value">{{state}}</view></view><view class="tag">{{state === 'SCANNING' ? '扫描中' : '空闲'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{state === 'ADAPTER_UNAVAILABLE'}}" class="error">请开启手机蓝牙并授予微信附近设备权限。开发者工具可能不支持 BLE，请使用真机。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="button-row"><button class="primary" bindtap="scan" disabled="{{state === 'SCANNING'}}">扫描 W02</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="stop" disabled="{{state !== 'SCANNING'}}">停止</button></view></view><view class="section-title">附近设备</view><view wx:if="{{!devices.length}}" class="panel muted">尚未发现设备。W02 通常以 W02_ 开头，但列表不会仅依赖名称过滤。</view><view wx:for="{{devices}}" wx:key="deviceId" class="panel"><view class="row"><view><view>{{item.displayName}}</view><view class="muted">RSSI {{item.RSSI || '-'}} dBm · {{item.lastSeenText}}</view></view><button size="mini" class="primary" data-id="{{item.deviceId}}" bindtap="connect">连接</button></view><view class="muted">{{item.deviceId}}</view></view></view>
